OL,3,GNEWSAHusband and wife died from impact
OL,4,Atrauma in plane crash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the deaths
OL,7,Fof a husband and wife who died in a
OL,8,Fplane crash.
OL,10,FSheetal Swali and Ketan Swali from
OL,11,FSyston, Leicestershire, were pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene after a light
OL,13,Faircraft they were in was found at a
OL,14,Fremote location close to Trawsfynydd,
OL,15,FGwynedd.
OL,17,FAir and ground searches were carried
OL,18,Fout to find the plane after police were
OL,19,Ftold just after 12:00 BST on Friday
OL,20,Fthat an aircraft had not arrived at
OL,21,FCaernarfon Airport as scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
