OL,3,GNEWSAHusband and wife died from impact
OL,4,Atrauma in plane crash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant coroner Sarah Riley said the
OL,7,Fcouple were travelling from Tatenhill
OL,8,FAirport in Burton-upon-Trent in a Piper
OL,9,FPA28 aircraft hired from Sherwood
OL,10,Fflying club.
